---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Official Disclaimer | Sarkari Sahayak 2026"
  description="Sarkari Sahayak ka official disclaimer — yeh govt website nahi hai, simulation demo hai, fees estimates hain, hamesha official sources verify karein."
  canonical="/disclaimer/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">

      <div class="section-head center-head">
        <p class="section-label">Disclaimer</p>
        <h1 class="section-title">Official Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="section-sub">Sarkari Sahayak use karne se pehle ye disclaimer zaroor padhein</p>
      </div>

      <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl); background:rgba(226,39,24,.08); border-color:rgba(226,39,24,.4)">
        <span class="disc-icon">🔴</span>
        <div class="disc-text">
          <strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> Sarkari Sahayak ek <strong>independent informational platform</strong> hai. Yeh <strong>kisi bhi sarkari, government, ya semi-government body ke officially affiliated nahi hai.</strong> Yeh website kisi bhi official process ka part nahi hai.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Not a Government Website</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Sarkari Sahayak ek <strong>private informational website</strong> hai — sarkari nahi</li>
          <li>Ye kisi bhi <strong>Ministry, Department, ya Government Organization</strong> ke sath affiliated nahi hai</li>
          <li>Ye website <strong>kisi bhi official process</strong> — jaise application, registration, result declaration — ka part nahi hai</li>
          <li>Hum <strong>kisi bhi government record ya database</strong> se connected nahi hain</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Simulation &amp; Demo Content</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Website pe jo <strong>marksheets, results, ya documents</strong> dikhte hain — wo sab <strong>simulation ya demo</strong> hain</li>
          <li>Inka <strong>real data se koi connection nahi hai</strong> — ye sirf dikhane ke liye hain ki actual document kaisa dikhta hai</li>
          <li>Humara koi bhi demo <strong>official document nahi hai</strong> — isko kisi bhi proof ke roop mein use na karein</li>
          <li>RBSE marksheet simulation, CBSE result preview — ye sab <strong>sirf educational demos</strong> hain</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Fees Are Estimates Only</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Website pe di gayi fees — jaise Aadhaar fees, PAN fees, Passport fees — <strong>sirf estimates</strong> hain</li>
          <li>Ye fees <strong>sarkari websites se li gayi hain</strong>, par <strong>badal sakti hain</strong> bina notice ke</li>
          <li>Hum <strong>100% accurate fees ki guarantee nahi dete</strong> — hamesha official website pe check karein</li>
          <li>Hum <strong>koi bhi fees collect nahi karte</strong> — hum sirf jaankari dete hain</li>
          <li>Processing fees, convenience charges, ya service tax — ye sab <strong>government websites pe applicable</strong> hain, humari taraf se nahi</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">No Professional Advice</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Sarkari Sahayak pe di gayi jaankari <strong>general guidance</strong> ke liye hai — <strong>professional legal, financial, ya official advice nahi</strong></li>
          <li>Agar aapko kisi specific case mein <strong>expert advice</strong> chahiye, toh aapko <strong>qualified professional</strong> se milna hoga</li>
          <li>Humari jaankari <strong>"as-is"</strong> hai — hum kisi bhi liability ke saath nahi dete</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Always Verify with Official Sources</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          <strong>Humari sabse badi salah:</strong> Har jaankari ke liye <strong>pehle official government website</strong> pe jaake verify karein.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Official websites pe jaake latest updates check karein</li>
          <li>Important dates, deadlines, aur fees — <strong>hamesha official source</strong> se confirm karein</li>
          <li>Kisi bhi <strong>third-party website</strong> (including Sarkari Sahayak) pe aankh band karke trust na karein</li>
          <li>Government processes mein <strong>sirf official portals</strong> ke through apply karein</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Third-Party Links</h2>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Website pe sirf <strong>official government domains</strong> ke links hain</li>
          <li>In links pe click karke aap <strong>third-party (sarkari) websites</strong> pe jaate hain</li>
          <li>Un websites ki <strong>content, privacy, aur availability</strong> ka zimmedaar Sarkari Sahayak nahi hai</li>
          <li>Kisi bhi external website pe jaane se pehle unki <strong>terms aur privacy policy</strong> padhein</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:28px">Contact for Corrections</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Agar aapko lagta hai ki humari website pe koi <strong>galat ya outdated jaankari</strong> hai, toh humein <a href="/contact" class="mini-link">contact karein</a>. Humari team jaldi se jaldi correct karegi.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <span class="disc-icon">⚠️</span>
        <div class="disc-text">
          <strong>Yad rakhein:</strong> Sarkari Sahayak sirf ek <strong>free informational guide</strong> hai. Hum kisi bhi government process ka part nahi hain. Har kaam ke liye <strong>official website pe jaana zaroori hai.</strong>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
